{
  "an10.115:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 10.115 ",
  "an10.115:0.2": "12. The Ceremony of Descent ",
  "an10.115:0.3": "Bad Principles (3rd) ",
  "an10.115:1.1": "“Mendicants, you should know bad principles and good principles. ",
  "an10.115:1.2": "And you should know bad results and good results. ",
  "an10.115:1.3": "Knowing these things, your practice should follow the good principles with good results.” ",
  "an10.115:1.4": "That is what the Buddha said. ",
  "an10.115:1.5": "When he had spoken, the Holy One rose from his seat and entered his dwelling. ",
  "an10.115:2.1": "Soon after the Buddha left, those mendicants considered, ",
  "an10.115:2.2": "“The Buddha gave this brief summary recital, then entered his dwelling without explaining the meaning in detail. ",
  "an10.115:2.3": "",
  "an10.115:2.4": "",
  "an10.115:2.5": "",
  "an10.115:2.6": "Who can explain in detail the meaning of this brief summary recital given by the Buddha?” ",
  "an10.115:3.1": "Then they considered, ",
  "an10.115:3.2": "“This Venerable Ānanda is praised by the Buddha and esteemed by his sensible spiritual companions. ",
  "an10.115:3.3": "He is capable of explaining in detail the meaning of this brief summary recital given by the Buddha. ",
  "an10.115:3.4": "Let’s go to him, and ask him about this matter. ",
  "an10.115:3.5": "As he answers, so we’ll remember it.” ",
  "an10.115:4.1": "Then those mendicants went to Ānanda, and exchanged greetings with him. ",
  "an10.115:4.2": "When the greetings and polit